# BuildKit ignore file for docker/framework-build-base/Dockerfile.
#
# BuildKit reads `<dockerfile path>.dockerignore` next to the Dockerfile, so
# this file applies whatever the context is. Patterns are relative to the
# CONTEXT root, which is a checkout of the commit being packaged.
#
# Keep it artifact-only: patterns match every path in the context, and a broad
# name (`**/data`, `**/build`) silently deletes source directories such as
# packages/spec/src/data.

# The image is public, and a checkout's .git/config can carry the credentials
# header actions/checkout writes. `.git` also differs on every checkout, so
# admitting it would rehash the COPY layer on every build.
**/.git

# Regenerated inside the image; never source.
**/node_modules
**/.pnpm-store
**/.turbo
